0.1.6

 - Resolve inconsistency in argument parsing behavior between GCC and Clang

0.1.5

 - Change some terminology to be more accurate
 - Fail out if invalid flags are provided
 - Display very slow speeds in Kbps if applicable 
 - Get download speeds directly from curl whenever possible
 - Handle the case where server may return 200 OK but not send any data
   (may happen if we get trapped at a JavaScript redirect or something similar that curl can't handle)

